Depends: perl-base, passwd, dpkg (>= 1.19), ca-certificates
Description: XDesk's built-in Ubuntu: what it needs to run inside the XDesk app
 The user xdesk (the desktop's, with a sudo that works without setuid), apt
 under the app's fake root, no snaps (Firefox and Chrome from their makers'
 repositories), Chrome's flags for the phone's GPU, xfwm4 without GLX vblank,
 and XDesk's own repository. Nothing about the look: XFCE stays as it comes.
